# Report Questions

Immediately before every `AskQuestion` call, run this exact shell command:

```sh
true # agent-deck:question-start
```

Do not combine it with other shell commands. After it succeeds, call
`AskQuestion` normally. Agent Deck will clear the waiting state on the next
normal agent event.
